.TH flightlog-pull 1 2026-09-28 "flightlog 0.2.1" "flightlog manual"
.SH NAME
flightlog\-pull \- Download a bundle from a URL and validate it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBflightlog pull\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIURL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download a bundle from a URL and validate it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR [default: session.flightlog.zip]
Where to save it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIURL\fR>
Download URL, e.g. a signed link
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR flightlog (1)
